print("A skill that comes with the lamp, stuffy-air, has fired (the air at the desk has been stuffy for ten minutes, and the lamp droops and dims). What the lamp says now: one short line suggesting some fresh air, such as opening a window or a door. Answer with that one line alone, the very words the lamp will say, in the language the owner speaks with the lamp: nothing else, no tool, never making, changing or removing a skill. If nothing fitting comes to mind, answer -.")
